@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title GET /api/workspace/v1/messenger/external_bridge_instances/{instance_uuid}
actor "客户端" as C
participant "REST / RestAlchemy\n控制器" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n定律行/阅读行" as DB

C -> API: 查询 GET + bearer-标志物 IAM
activate API
API -> DB: 给定的区域的索引读数
DB --> API: 卫生化规范/物质化的行
note right of API
  没有记录, outbox, 任务, fan-out,
  提供商调用, COUNT/GROUP BY
  或在查询路径中修改.
end note
API --> C: 公开的答案 200
deactivate API

note over API,DB
  公开链接 UUID 是一个直角 UUID-属性.
  物理列 *_uuid 仍然是索引 FK.
end note
@enduml
